全体：♪ 让我们一起唱歌
路歌♪

07:23.379 --> 07:24.689
[clap clap]
[鼓掌鼓掌]

07:24.793 --> 07:28.310
- ♪ I WANT TO SING IT
ALL DAY LONG ♪
- ♪ 我想唱它
一整天♪

07:28.413 --> 07:30.931
all: ♪ LET'S ALL SING
THE ROAD SONG ♪
全体：♪ 让我们一起唱歌
路歌♪

07:31.034 --> 07:32.689
[clap clap]
[鼓掌鼓掌]

07:32.793 --> 07:35.586
all: ♪ LET'S ALL SING...
- ♪ ROAD. ROAD. ROAD. ROAD.
全体：♪ 让我们一起唱吧……
- ♪ 路。路。路。路。

07:35.689 --> 07:42.448
all: ♪ ALONG
- ♪ ROAD. ROAD. ROAD. RO-O-AD
全部：♪ 一起
- ♪ 路。路。路。 RO-O-AD

07:42.551 --> 07:44.034
[crash]
[碰撞]

07:45.793 --> 07:49.620
- UM, ANYBODY KNOW ANY OTHER
GOOD ROAD TUNES?
- 嗯，有谁知道其他的吗
公路音乐好听吗？

07:49.724 --> 07:50.931
[hawaiian music]
[夏威夷音乐]

07:51.034 --> 07:52.000
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪

07:52.103 --> 07:56.379
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

07:56.482 --> 07:59.413
- OOF. URG. OH.
- 噢。乌尔格。哦。

07:59.517 --> 08:02.137
- HOW MUCH FARTHER
TO THE NEAREST SERVICE STATION?
- 还有多远
去最近的服务站？

08:02.241 --> 08:05.137
- UH, PROBABLY
PRETTY FAR, SON.
- 呃，可能
相当远，儿子。

08:05.241 --> 08:06.310
[honk]
[鸣喇叭]

08:07.482 --> 08:08.827
- OH,
I GUESS YOU'RE RIGHT.
- 哦，
我想你是对的。

08:11.137 --> 08:12.379
[banjo music]
[班卓琴音乐]

08:12.482 --> 08:13.482
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪

08:13.586 --> 08:15.172
- SO, UH,
HOW'S IT LOOKING?
- 那么，呃，
看起来怎么样？

08:16.896 --> 08:20.379
- WELL, GOT A CRACKED
TIMING CASE COVER,
- 嗯，有裂缝
正时箱盖，

08:20.482 --> 08:24.827
IT'S BROKEN A COUPLE OF TEETH
OFF THE TIMING GEAR,
几颗牙齿断了
关闭正时齿轮，

08:24.931 --> 08:28.758
THE RADIATOR'S DAMAGED
AT THE CORE,
散热器损坏
核心是，

08:28.862 --> 08:31.413
YOU GOT
A CRACKED WATER PUMP,
你得到了
破裂的水泵，

08:31.517 --> 08:35.310
AND A FRACTURED
INJECTOR LINE.
和骨折的
喷射器管线。

08:35.413 --> 08:36.896
- AND WHAT DOES
ALL THAT MEAN?
- 以及有什么作用
这一切意味着什么？

08:37.000 --> 08:39.827
- WELL, LITTLE MISSY,
IN TECHNICAL TERMS,
- 好吧，小小姐，
从技术角度来说，

08:39.931 --> 08:41.482
[sniff]
[嗅嗅]

08:41.586 --> 08:44.827
IF SHE SHE DON'T WANT TO RUN,
SHE DON'T WANT TO RUN,
如果她不想跑，
她不想跑，

08:47.206 --> 08:48.862
- UH-HUH.
AHEM.
- 呃哈。
咳咳。

08:48.965 --> 08:51.448
OH, SO WHAT ARE WE LOOKING AT,
TIME-WISE?
哦，那么我们在看什么，
时间方面？

08:51.551 --> 08:54.862
- WELL,
NOW THAT DEPENDS.
- 嗯，
现在就看情况了。

08:54.965 --> 08:56.793
HOW MUCH
TIME YOU GOT?
多少钱
你有时间吗？

08:56.896 --> 09:00.551
[wheezy laugh]
[气喘吁吁的笑声]

09:00.655 --> 09:02.724
- [laughing]
- [笑]

09:02.827 --> 09:05.172
HOW MUCH T--
UH...
多少钱——
呃……

09:05.275 --> 09:06.620
NOT FUNNY.
不好笑。

09:09.241 --> 09:12.137
- HEY! AT LEAST THEY HAVE
A COZY-LOOKING WAITING ROOM.
- 嘿！至少他们有
看起来舒适的候诊室。

09:15.137 --> 09:16.103
HEY, COME ON.
嘿，来吧。

09:17.448 --> 09:19.931
MAN,
AM I BORED.
男人，
我很无聊吗？

09:20.034 --> 09:22.586
- I AM
BEYOND BORED.
- 我是
超越无聊。

09:22.689 --> 09:24.896
I'M...
BEE-ORED.
我是...
蜂矿石。

09:25.000 --> 09:29.000
- OH, BOYS! IS THAT A PLAYGROUND
NEXT DOOR I SEE?
- 哦，孩子们！那是游乐场吗
我看到隔壁了吗？

09:30.344 --> 09:35.103
both: PLAYGROUND!
两者：游乐场！

09:35.206 --> 09:36.413
both: HMM.
两者：嗯。

09:36.517 --> 09:39.275
- NOT THE MOST
COLORFUL PLAYGROUND I'VE SEEN.
- 不是最多的
我见过的色彩缤纷的游乐场。

09:39.379 --> 09:40.655
- MM-MMM.
- 嗯嗯。

09:40.758 --> 09:42.310
THIS LOOKS MORE LIKE
A GRAY-GROUND.
这看起来更像
灰色地带。

09:44.413 --> 09:47.000
- WELL, I'LL JUST LEAVE YOU TWO
HERE TO AMUSE YOURSELVES,
- 好吧，我就只剩下你们两个了
来这里自娱自乐，

09:47.103 --> 09:49.413
AND COME BACK FOR YOU
WHEN THE BOAT'S FIXED.
回来找你
当船修好后。

09:49.517 --> 09:51.862
- UM, ACTUALLY THIS PLACE
SEEMS A LITTLE BIT--
- 嗯，实际上是这个地方
好像有一点——

09:51.965 --> 09:52.965
- HAVE FUN!
- 玩得开心！

09:53.068 --> 09:55.448
- WELL,
THIS IS A NASTY TURN OF EVENTS.
- 嗯，
这是一个令人讨厌的事件转折。

09:55.551 --> 09:57.137
- YOU'RE PREACHING TO THE CHOIR,
PATRICK.
- 你正在向合唱团布道，
帕特里克。

09:57.241 --> 09:58.896
- I KNEW IT WAS GONNA HAPPEN,
TOO.
- 我知道这会发生，
太。

09:59.000 --> 10:00.379
- YOU DID?
HOW?
- 你做到了？
如何？

10:00.482 --> 10:02.793
- 'CAUSE IT HAPPENS EVERY TIME
I KEEP MY CHEESE FIZZ
- 因为它每次都会发生
我让奶酪起泡

10:02.896 --> 10:04.172
IN MY BACK POCKET.
在我的后口袋里。

10:04.275 --> 10:05.275
[splurch]
[污迹]

10:05.379 --> 10:07.448
DARN!
IT'S ALMOST EMPTY.
该死！
几乎是空的。

10:07.551 --> 10:10.448
- WELL, I GUESS WE'LL JUST
HAVE TO MAKE THE BEST OF IT.
- 好吧，我想我们就这样
必须充分利用它。

10:10.551 --> 10:13.517
♪ AH LA LA LA
THIS IS FUN.
♪ 啊啦啦啦
这很有趣。

10:13.620 --> 10:14.758
HEY, PATRICK,
YOU GOTTA TRY THIS--
嘿，帕特里克，
你一定要试试这个——

10:14.862 --> 10:16.793
[garble]
[断章取义]

10:16.896 --> 10:18.586
[splurch]
- HUH?
[污迹]
- 嗯？

10:18.689 --> 10:20.965
SPONGEBOB,
WERE YOU TALKIN' TO ME?
海绵宝宝，
你在跟我说话吗？

10:21.068 --> 10:25.000
I COULDA SWORN SPONGEBOB WAS
CALLIN' ME FROM THIS DIRECTION.
我可以发誓海绵宝宝是
从这个方向呼唤我。

10:25.103 --> 10:27.241
SPONGEBOB,
WHERE ARE YOU?
海绵宝宝，
你在哪里？

10:27.344 --> 10:28.206
- HEY,
PATRICK.
- 嘿，
帕特里克。

10:28.310 --> 10:29.241
- HUH.
- 嗯。

10:29.344 --> 10:30.655
SPONGEBOB?
海绵宝宝？

10:30.758 --> 10:31.827
AW, COME ON,
WHERE ARE YOU HIDING?
噢，来吧，
你藏在哪里？

10:31.931 --> 10:33.689
THIS ISN'T FUNNY.
这不好笑。

10:33.793 --> 10:36.000
HUH.
- PATRICK, I'M RIGHT HERE.
呵呵。
- 帕特里克，我就在这里。

10:36.103 --> 10:38.620
- OH, HEY, SPONGEBOB.
HOW'D YOU GET THERE?
- 哦，嘿，海绵宝宝。
你怎么到那里的？

10:38.724 --> 10:39.793
- WELL,
I WAS ON THIS SEESAW--
- 嗯，
我在这个跷跷板上——

10:39.896 --> 10:40.793
- SLIDE!
- 滑动！

10:40.896 --> 10:44.034
HA!
[laughs excitedly]
哈！
[兴奋地笑]

10:52.344 --> 10:53.689
[strains]
[菌株]

10:53.793 --> 10:54.827
[smack]
- OOF!
[咂]
- 噢！

10:54.931 --> 10:56.448
- PATRICK,
DO YOU NEED HELP?
- 帕特里克，
您需要帮助吗？

10:56.551 --> 10:57.620
- HUH?
- 嗯？

10:57.724 --> 10:59.931
OH, WITH THIS SLIDE
STUCK TO MY BOTTOM?
哦，有了这张幻灯片
被困在谷底了吗？

11:00.034 --> 11:02.103
NAR, HUH.
I WANT IT THERE.
纳尔，呵呵。
我想要它。

11:05.379 --> 11:06.379
I HATE YOU,
SLIDE!
我恨你，
滑动！

11:06.482 --> 11:07.482
[strains]
[菌株]

11:07.586 --> 11:08.586
OOF!
钱币！

11:11.482 --> 11:13.517
OH, SORRY,
SPONGEBOB.
哦，对不起，
海绵宝宝。

11:16.517 --> 11:18.724
- HEY, LOOK,
A SWING SET!
- 嘿，看，
秋千套装！

11:25.172 --> 11:26.103
CAN'T GO WRONG
WITH THIS
不会出错
有了这个

11:26.206 --> 11:27.620
ALL-TIME
PLAYGROUND FAVORITE.
空前的
游乐场最爱。

11:29.275 --> 11:31.241
WHEE.
哇。

11:31.344 --> 11:32.827
HEY,
THIS IS ALMOST
嘿，
这差不多了

11:32.931 --> 11:34.862
LIKE BEING
AT THE GREAT BARRIER REEF, HUH?
就像存在一样
在大堡礁，嗯？

11:34.965 --> 11:36.586
TRY IT,
PATRICK.
尝试一下，
帕特里克。

11:36.689 --> 11:37.827
- OKAY.
- 好的。

11:40.448 --> 11:41.448
IT'S NOT WORKING.
它不起作用。

11:41.551 --> 11:42.758
- NO, GO BACK AND FORTH,
LIKE THIS.
- 不，来来回回，
像这样。

11:42.862 --> 11:44.034
UH, UH, UH, UH.
呃，呃，呃，呃。

11:44.137 --> 11:45.551
THERE YOU GO,
就这样，

11:45.655 --> 11:47.517
NOW YOU'RE GETTIN' INTO THE...
SWING OF THINGS.
现在您正在进入...
事物的摇摆。

11:47.620 --> 11:51.655
♪ BA LA LA LA LA
- [laughs excitedly]
♪ 巴啦啦啦啦
- [兴奋地笑]

11:51.758 --> 11:54.275
HEY!
WATCH ME...
嘿！
看着我...

11:54.379 --> 11:55.724
GO!
去！

11:55.827 --> 11:57.275
OH! OH-WHOA!
哦！噢-哇！

11:57.379 --> 11:58.620
- PATRICK?
- 帕特里克？

11:58.724 --> 12:01.206
- GO! GO! GO! GO! GO! GO!
- 去！去！去！去！去！去！

12:01.310 --> 12:02.620
WHOA!
哇啊！

12:02.724 --> 12:05.413
- PATRICK!
I'M COMING!
- 帕特里克！
我来了！

12:05.517 --> 12:06.724
- YOW!
- 哟！

12:06.827 --> 12:07.965
- AAH!
- 啊啊！

12:08.068 --> 12:11.103
- YOW! OW!
OW!
- 哟！噢！
噢！

12:11.206 --> 12:13.000
- WAH! AI-AH!
WAH!
- 哇！哎呀！
哇！

12:13.103 --> 12:15.172
[screaming]
[尖叫]

12:15.275 --> 12:18.586
- [screaming]
YOW! OW! OW!
- [尖叫]
哟！噢！噢！

12:18.689 --> 12:21.620
- [screaming]
WAH! AH! AH!
- [尖叫]
哇！啊！啊！

12:21.724 --> 12:24.620
AH! OH.
啊！哦。

12:27.310 --> 12:28.379
- PATRICK?
- 帕特里克？

12:28.482 --> 12:29.413
- [gurgling]
SPONGEBOB.
- [咯咯声]
海绵宝宝。

12:29.517 --> 12:31.137
- PATRICK!
ARE YOU OKAY?
- 帕特里克！
你还好吗？

12:31.241 --> 12:33.586
- NO. I'M NOT OKAY.
- YOU'RE NOT?
- 不。我不好。
- 你不？

12:33.689 --> 12:35.620
- NO.
I'M GREAT!
- 不。
我太棒了！

12:35.724 --> 12:38.068
THAT WAS
AWEOME!
那是
太棒了！

12:38.172 --> 12:39.655
HUH,
LET'S DO IT AGAIN!
呵呵，
让我们再做一次！

12:41.586 --> 12:43.344
- YEAH!
PATRICK, WAIT.
- 是的！
帕特里克，等等。

12:49.448 --> 12:52.827
SOMETHING TELLS ME,
THAT IS A ONE-WAY DRAIN.
有件事告诉我，
这是一条单向排水沟。

12:55.620 --> 12:59.517
UH, HOW LONG HAVE WE
BEEN WALKING HERE, PATRICK?
呃，我们多久了
帕特里克，一直在这儿散步吗？

12:59.620 --> 13:02.379
- WELL,
THAT DEPENDS ON WHO YOU ASK.
- 嗯，
这取决于你问的是谁。

13:02.482 --> 13:03.758
- WHY?
- 为什么？

13:03.862 --> 13:06.379
- WELL, 'CAUSE IF
YOU ASK SOMEONE WITH A WATCH,
- 好吧，因为如果
你问一个戴手表的人，

13:06.482 --> 13:07.655
THEY MIGHT BE ABLE
TO TELL YOU.
他们也许能够
告诉你。

13:07.758 --> 13:08.965
[rumble]
[隆隆]

13:09.068 --> 13:10.517
- ARE YOU
GETTIN' HUNGRY?
- 你是吗
饿了吗？

13:10.620 --> 13:12.827
- YEAH!
HOW'D YOU KNOW?
- 是的！
你怎么知道的？

13:12.931 --> 13:14.724
- OH, I COULD HEAR
YOUR STOMACH GROWLING.
- 哦，我能听到
你的肚子咕咕叫。

13:14.827 --> 13:15.827
I THOUGHT
FOR A SECOND,
我以为
一秒钟，

13:15.931 --> 13:17.551
IT MIGHT BE SOME KIND OF
SCALY MONSTER
这可能是某种
鳞片怪物

13:17.655 --> 13:18.896
COMING
TO EAT US.
即将到来
吃掉我们。

13:19.000 --> 13:22.482
[hearty laughter]
[爽朗的笑声]

13:22.586 --> 13:23.862
- THAT'S FUNNY.
- 那很好笑。

13:23.965 --> 13:25.896
COULDN'T HAVE BEEN MY STOMACH
GROWLING, THOUGH.
不可能是我的胃
不过，咆哮。

13:26.000 --> 13:27.068
- IT COULDN'T?
- NOPE!
- 不能？
- 没有！

13:27.172 --> 13:29.655
I HAD ITS VOCAL CHORDS REMOVED
BEFORE THE TRIP.
我把它的和弦去掉了
旅行之前。

13:29.758 --> 13:31.137
- WELL, I COULD HAVE SWORN
THAT I HEARD--
- 好吧，我可以发誓
我听到的——

13:31.241 --> 13:32.379
[growling rumble]
[咆哮隆隆声]

13:32.482 --> 13:34.344
SPONGEBOB! I HEARD IT,
I HEARD GROWLING!
海绵宝宝！我听到了，
我听到咆哮声！

13:34.448 --> 13:36.862
- NO, THAT TIME
IT WAS MY STOMACH.
- 不，那个时候
这是我的胃。

13:36.965 --> 13:39.206
THERE'S GOTTA BE
SOMETHING AROUND HERE TO EAT.
一定有
这里有东西可以吃。

13:39.310 --> 13:40.827
MMM!
嗯！

13:40.931 --> 13:42.551
[chomp]
[munch]
[咀嚼]
[咀嚼]

13:42.655 --> 13:44.172
PATRICK, I FOUND
SOME BERRIES WE CAN--
帕特里克，我发现
我们可以吃一些浆果——

13:44.275 --> 13:45.275
OOF!
钱币！

13:45.379 --> 13:47.068
NOT...EAT!
不...吃！

13:47.172 --> 13:48.517
- [chomp]
[munch]
- [咀嚼]
[咀嚼]

13:48.620 --> 13:50.965
[munch munch munch]
[咀嚼咀嚼]

13:51.068 --> 13:52.103
THANKS FOR
THE WARNING.
感谢
警告。

13:52.206 --> 13:53.793
- PATRICK,
WHERE DID YOU GET--
- 帕特里克，
你从哪里得到的——

13:53.896 --> 13:54.965
[thunderous pop]
[雷鸣般的爆裂声]

13:55.068 --> 13:56.517
[cork pop]
- THE CUPCAKE?
[软木塞流行]
- 纸杯蛋糕？

13:56.620 --> 13:58.241
- FROM
THE VENDING MACHINE.
- 来自
自动售货机。

13:58.344 --> 13:59.931
[magical guitar chord]
[神奇的吉他和弦]

14:00.034 --> 14:01.896
- O-OH.
- 哦-哦。

14:02.000 --> 14:04.137
[mighty grumble]
[强烈的抱怨]

14:04.241 --> 14:05.482
- WAS IT YOUR STOMACH THAT TIME,
TOO?
- 那时是你的胃吗？
太？

14:05.586 --> 14:07.241
- NOPE.
- 没有。

14:07.344 --> 14:08.827
RUN FOR YOUR LIFE!
为你的生命而奔跑！

14:14.379 --> 14:17.896
- ROAR!
- 咆哮！

14:18.000 --> 14:19.137
[wiggle]
[扭动]

14:20.379 --> 14:22.413
- IT'S COMING CLOSER!
- 越来越近了！

14:22.517 --> 14:23.724
[screech]
[尖叫]

14:23.827 --> 14:24.724
[wobble wobble]
[晃晃悠悠]

14:24.827 --> 14:27.103
OH, NO!
IT'S A SHEER DROP-OFF!
哦，不！
这是一个纯粹的下降！

14:27.206 --> 14:28.137
NOW WHAT
DO WE DO?
现在怎么办
我们这样做吗？

14:28.241 --> 14:29.551
- DON'T ASK ME.
- 别问我。

14:29.655 --> 14:30.896
I DON'T REMEMBER
我不记得了

14:31.000 --> 14:34.034
"BEING EATEN ALIVE"
ON THIS TRIP'S ITINERARY.
“被活活吃掉”
关于这次旅行的行程。

14:34.137 --> 14:36.793
- I'M TOO YOUNG
TO BE DIGESTED!
- 我还太年轻
待消化！

14:36.896 --> 14:38.793
[sobbing]
[抽泣]

14:38.896 --> 14:40.103
- WAIT,
SPONGEBOB.
- 等等，
海绵宝宝。

14:40.206 --> 14:41.448
I KNOW HOW TO GET US
OUT OF THIS.
我知道如何联系我们
出于这个。

14:41.551 --> 14:42.655
- YOU DO?
- 你做？

14:42.758 --> 14:44.551
- I SAW SOMETHING JUST LIKE THIS
IN A MOVIE ONCE.
- 我看到了类似这样的东西
曾经在电影中出现过。

14:44.655 --> 14:46.344
NOW,
WATCH CLOSELY,
现在，
仔细观察，

14:46.448 --> 14:48.793
AND DO EXACTLY
WHAT I DO.
并准确地做
我做什么。

14:48.896 --> 14:50.000
- ROGER.
- 罗杰。

14:52.793 --> 14:54.000
- OKAY,
NOW WHAT?
- 好吧，
现在怎么办？

14:54.103 --> 14:55.172
- UH,
I'M NOT SURE.
- 呃，
我不确定。

14:55.275 --> 14:57.137
I FELL ASLEEP
IN THE SECOND HALF OF THE MOVIE.
我睡着了
在电影的后半部分。

14:59.034 --> 15:00.965
[screaming]
[尖叫]

15:02.896 --> 15:05.655
- WELL, I HOPE THAT MONSTER'S
CARRYING SOME SYRUP.
- 好吧，我希望那个怪物是
携带一些糖浆。

15:05.758 --> 15:08.482
- YEAH, 'CAUSE IF HE EATS US,
HE'S HAVING PANCAKES FOR LUNCH.
- 是的，因为如果他吃了我们，
他午餐吃煎饼。

15:08.586 --> 15:10.068
[sproing]
both: WHOA!
[发芽]
两人：哇！

15:12.862 --> 15:16.517
[relieved laughter]
[释然的笑声]

15:16.620 --> 15:17.827
- PATRICK,
WE DID IT!
- 帕特里克，
我们做到了！

15:17.931 --> 15:18.965
- WE'RE NOT
GONNA BE EATEN!
- 我们不是
会被吃掉！

15:19.068 --> 15:20.206
- HOORAY,
FOR NOT BEING EATEN!
- 万岁，
为了不被吃掉！

15:20.310 --> 15:21.827
- HOORAY!
- 万岁！

15:21.931 --> 15:26.068
♪ WE'RE NOT GONNA BE EATEN,
WE'RE NOT GONNA BE EATEN ♪
♪ 我们不会被吃掉，
我们不会被吃掉 ♪

15:26.172 --> 15:28.344
- HEY, SPONGEBOB?
- YEAH, PATRICK.
- 嘿，海绵宝宝？
- 是的，帕特里克。

15:28.448 --> 15:32.000
- ALL THIS NOT-BEING-EATEN
IS MAKING ME HUNGRY.
- 所有这些不被吃掉的东西
让我饿了。

15:32.103 --> 15:33.379
- OH, HO,
DON'T WORRY.
- 哦，哦，
别担心。

15:33.482 --> 15:35.137
WHEN WE GET
TO THE GREAT BARRIER REEF,
当我们得到
前往大堡礁，

15:35.241 --> 15:36.344
WE'LL EAT
LIKE KINGS.
我们要吃
像国王一样。

15:36.448 --> 15:37.448
- ALL RIGHT!
- 好的！

15:37.551 --> 15:38.551
- ALL RIGHT!
- 好的！

15:38.655 --> 15:39.862
NOW, PUT HER THERE,
PATRICK.
现在，把她放在那里，
帕特里克。

15:39.965 --> 15:41.241
PUT HER THERE!
把她放在那里！

15:41.344 --> 15:42.275
[squish]
[挤压]

15:42.379 --> 15:43.448
- EW,
PATRICK,
- 电子战，
帕特里克，

15:43.551 --> 15:45.172
HAVE YOU BEEN USING
A DIFFERENT MOISTURIZER?
你用过吗
不同的保湿霜？

15:45.275 --> 15:46.862
YOUR HANDS
FEEL KIND OF--
你的手
感觉有点——

15:46.965 --> 15:48.551
[horrified garble]
[惊恐的乱码]

15:51.103 --> 15:52.379
- OH, NO,
IT'S--
- 哦，不，
这是——

15:52.482 --> 15:54.896
IT'S JUST THE SAME OLD
MOISTURIZER I ALWAYS USE.
还是老样子
我经常使用的保湿霜。

15:55.000 --> 15:57.172
- [sputtering babble]
- [喋喋不休的胡言乱语]

15:57.275 --> 15:58.413
- AW, COME ON,
SPONGEBOB,
- 噢，来吧，
海绵宝宝，

15:58.517 --> 15:59.793
DON'T LEAVE ME
HANGING HERE.
别离开我
挂在这里。

15:59.896 --> 16:01.862
- [confused blather]
- [困惑的胡言乱语]

16:01.965 --> 16:03.482
- LET ME GUESS,
- 让我猜猜，

16:03.586 --> 16:05.172
IT'S TIME
TO START SCREAMING AGAIN?
是时候了
又要开始尖叫了吗？

16:05.275 --> 16:07.206
- ONE SECOND.
- 一秒钟。

16:07.310 --> 16:08.310
OKAY, NOW.
好的，现在。

16:08.413 --> 16:11.931
[screaming]
[尖叫]

16:13.931 --> 16:15.896
[screaming]
[尖叫]

16:16.000 --> 16:17.413
[falling screaming]
[摔倒尖叫]

16:17.517 --> 16:20.758
- SPONGEBOB, AS MUCH AS I'D
LIKE TO STAY AND HANG AROUND,
- 海绵宝宝，尽我所能
喜欢留下来闲逛，

16:20.862 --> 16:23.206
I'M NOT SURE THAT
NOW'S THE BEST TIME.
我不确定
现在是最好的时机。

16:23.310 --> 16:24.206
- I KNOW,
PATRICK,
- 我知道，
帕特里克，

16:24.310 --> 16:25.275
BUT RIGHT NOW,
IT SEEMS TO BE--
但现在，
看起来是——

16:25.379 --> 16:26.413
[excited babble]
[gasping]
[兴奋的胡言乱语]
[喘气]

16:26.517 --> 16:27.965
OUR BEST POSSIBLE
COURSE OF ACTION.
我们尽力而为
行动过程。

16:28.068 --> 16:30.310
- WELL,
I PROBABLY
- 嗯，
我可能

16:30.413 --> 16:32.206
WOULD REALLY
BE ENJOYING THE VIEW
真的会吗
欣赏美景

16:32.310 --> 16:36.206
IF I STILL HAD SOME BLOOD
FLOWING TO MY ARMS. OW.
如果我还有血的话
流向我的怀抱。哦。

16:36.310 --> 16:37.344
- DON'T WORRY,
PATRICK,
- 别担心，
帕特里克，

16:37.448 --> 16:38.586
YOUR BLOOD-FLOW IS
NOT THE ONLY THING
您的血流量是
不是唯一的事情

16:38.689 --> 16:39.655
THAT'S
WEARING THIN.
那是
穿得单薄。

16:39.758 --> 16:40.689
[snap]
[折断]

16:40.793 --> 16:43.000
[screaming]
[尖叫]

16:43.103 --> 16:44.275
- GRAB IT,
PATRICK!
- 抓住它，
帕特里克！

16:44.379 --> 16:46.137
- G-GRABBING!
- G-抓住！

16:46.241 --> 16:47.793
- [naseous wailing]
- [鼻涕嚎叫]

16:47.896 --> 16:50.344
- OKAY, SPONGEBOB,
YOUR TURN!
- 好吧，海绵宝宝，
轮到你了！

16:50.448 --> 16:51.517
- [snoring]
- SPONGEBOB!
- [打鼾]
- 海绵宝宝！

16:51.620 --> 16:53.000
- HUH?
OH, I GOT IT.
- 嗯？
哦，我明白了。

17:02.103 --> 17:04.034
[head scratching]
[抓头]

17:06.586 --> 17:08.896
- PHEW! THAT WAS A CLOSE ONE,
HUH, PATRICK?
- 唷！那是一场很接近的比赛，
嗯，帕特里克？

17:09.000 --> 17:10.137
- YEAH.
- 是的。

17:10.241 --> 17:12.206
BUT IT LOOKS LIKE EVERTHING
WORKED OUT JUST--
但看起来一切都一样
刚锻炼完——

17:12.310 --> 17:13.379
VINE.
HA.
藤。
哈。

17:13.482 --> 17:14.586
[ringing]
[铃声]

17:14.689 --> 17:15.724
- PATRICK.
PATRICK?
- 帕特里克。
帕特里克？

17:15.827 --> 17:16.965
DID YOU HEAR THAT?
你听到了吗？

17:17.068 --> 17:18.689
- IT SOUNDED LIKE IT CAME
FROM THE OTHER SIDE
- 听起来就像它来了
从另一边

17:18.793 --> 17:19.862
OF THIS BIG ROCK.
这块大石头的。

17:19.965 --> 17:20.862
THIS ISN'T
A BIG ROCK.
这不是
一块大石头。

17:20.965 --> 17:22.310
IT'S A BIG WALL.
这是一堵大墙。

17:22.413 --> 17:24.931
- DO YOU SUPPOSE IT BELONGS
TO THAT GIFT SHOP RIGHT THERE?
- 你认为它属于吗
去那里的礼品店？

17:25.034 --> 17:27.034
- WHAT WOULD A GIFT SHOP
BE DOING,
- 礼品店会是什么样子
正在做，

17:27.137 --> 17:28.448
RIGHT IN THE MIDDLE
OF NOWHERE?
就在中间
无处可去？

17:28.551 --> 17:30.103
- I--
UH, SELLING GIFTS?
- 我--
呃，卖礼物？

17:30.206 --> 17:32.068
[ringing]
- WOW, PATRICK,
[铃声]
- 哇，帕特里克，

17:32.172 --> 17:33.689
LOOK AT
ALL THIS STUFF!
看看
所有这些东西！

17:36.241 --> 17:37.482
YOU GONNA
BUY SOMETHING?
你要
买东西？

17:37.586 --> 17:40.379
- NAH, I'M NOT IN THE MARKET
FOR ANY SOUVENIRS.
- 不，我不在市场上
对于任何纪念品。

17:40.482 --> 17:42.103
- [chuckling] OH-HO, YOU CAN
NEVER HAVE TOO MANY SOUVEN--
- [咯咯笑]哦，你可以
纪念品永远不嫌多——

17:42.206 --> 17:43.275
[gasps]
[喘气]

17:43.379 --> 17:45.137
OH, NO. I JUST REALIZED
WHAT THIS PLACE IS!
哦，不。我刚刚意识到
这是什么地方！

17:45.241 --> 17:46.275
- YOU HAVE?
- 你有吗？

17:46.379 --> 17:49.034
- PATRICK,
WE HAVE WALKED STRAIGHT INTO A--
- 帕特里克，
我们已经径直走进了——

17:49.137 --> 17:50.931
[whispering]
TOURIST TRAP.
[窃窃私语]
旅游陷阱。

17:51.034 --> 17:52.827
- A TRAP!
- SHH.
- 陷阱！
-嘘。

17:52.931 --> 17:53.862
- [whispering]
A TRAP.
- [低语]
一个陷阱。

17:53.965 --> 17:55.344
- COME ON.
LET'S ESCAPE,
- 快点。
让我们逃吧，

17:55.448 --> 17:57.275
BEFORE WE SPEND ALL OUR MONEY
ON USELESS TRINKETS.
在我们花完所有的钱之前
关于无用的饰品。

17:59.137 --> 18:00.344
PATRICK, WAIT.
帕特里克，等等。

18:00.448 --> 18:02.137
I SAW A VERY NICE
DRIFTWOOD SCULPTURE OVER THERE,
我看到一个非常好的
那边的浮木雕塑，

18:02.241 --> 18:04.517
THAT WOULD WORK GREAT
AS A MANTLEPIECE.
那会很好用
作为壁炉架。

18:04.620 --> 18:07.137
- SPONGEBOB,
NO!
- 海绵宝宝，
不！

18:08.655 --> 18:09.965
- [sobs]
- [抽泣]

18:10.068 --> 18:11.965
- SPONGEBOB!
- 海绵宝宝！

18:12.068 --> 18:15.586
- PATRICK, THAT TOURIST TRAP
TOOK ME FOR EVERYTHING I HAD.
- 帕特里克，那个旅游陷阱
夺走了我所拥有的一切。

18:15.689 --> 18:18.482
NOW WE DON'T HAVE ANY MONEY,
WE'RE STILL LOST,
现在我们没有钱，
我们仍然迷失，

18:18.586 --> 18:20.482
AND WE'RE GONNA BE
IN BIG TROUBLE.
我们将会成为
遇到大麻烦了。

18:20.586 --> 18:23.448
OH!
THIS VACATION IS A DISASTER!
哦！
这个假期是一场灾难！

18:23.551 --> 18:25.000
[weeps]
[哭泣]

18:25.103 --> 18:27.517
- SPONGEBOB, I--
- [wails]
-海绵宝宝，我--
- [哀号]

18:27.620 --> 18:30.758
[blubbering nonsense]
【胡言乱语】

18:30.862 --> 18:34.103
- I DON'T THINK THIS VACATION'S
BEEN A DISASTER.
- 我不认为这个假期
真是一场灾难。

18:34.206 --> 18:35.896
- [gurgles]
- [咯咯声]

18:36.000 --> 18:36.931
YOU DON'T?
你不这样做吗？

18:37.034 --> 18:39.448
- NO, OF COURSE NOT.
SEE!
- 不，当然不是。
看！

18:39.551 --> 18:40.827
WE DID EVERYTHING
WE DREAMT OF DOING
我们做了一切
我们梦想做的事

18:40.931 --> 18:42.310
AT
THE GREAT BARRIER REEF.
AT
大堡礁。

18:42.413 --> 18:43.827
- PATRICK,
YOU'RE RIGHT!
- 帕特里克，
你是对的！

18:43.931 --> 18:45.586
WE WENT
DOWN A SEWAGE PIPE...
我们去了
沿着污水管...

18:45.689 --> 18:46.689
- LIKE A SLIDE...
- 像幻灯片一样...

18:46.793 --> 18:48.586
- BOUNCED OFF
A HUGE ANEMONE...
- 弹开
巨大的海葵...

18:48.689 --> 18:50.310
- LIKE
A TRAMPOLINE...
- 喜欢
一个蹦床...

18:50.413 --> 18:51.310
- HID IN A NEST.
- 躲进窝里。

18:51.413 --> 18:52.689
- LIKE A FORT...
- 像堡垒一样...

18:52.793 --> 18:55.551
- AND SWUNG ON SOME VINES,
WHICH ARE A LOT LIKE ROPES.
- 并在一些藤蔓上摇摆，
这很像绳子。

18:55.655 --> 18:57.689
THIS VACATION
HAS IT ALL!
这个假期
应有尽有！

18:57.793 --> 19:00.068
- ALL EXCEPT
FOR ONE THING.
- 除了
一方面。

19:00.172 --> 19:01.137
- WHAT'S THAT?
- 那是什么？

19:01.241 --> 19:02.551
- A WAY OUTTA HERE.
- 离开这里的路。

19:02.655 --> 19:04.862
- MY POOR PARENTS
MUST BE WORRIED SICK.
- 我可怜的父母
一定是担心生病了。

19:04.965 --> 19:09.068
- I SUGGEST WE TAKE A NAP HERE
UNTIL THEY COME AND FIND US.
- 我建议我们在这里小睡一会儿
直到他们来找到我们。

19:09.172 --> 19:11.862
THAT WAY, WE'LL BE WELL-RESTED
FOR THE RIDE HOME.
这样我们就能得到充分的休息
乘车回家。

19:11.965 --> 19:13.724
- I SUGGEST
WE START WALKING.
- 我建议
我们开始步行。

19:13.827 --> 19:16.379
- I WAS AFRAID
HE WAS GONNA SUGGEST THAT.
- 我很害怕
他本来打算这么建议的。

19:16.482 --> 19:20.310
- [exhausted]
♪ WHEN I'M ON THE ROAD
- [筋疲力尽]
♪ 当我在路上时

19:20.413 --> 19:22.068
- [exhausted]
♪ I SEE STUFF GOING BY
- [筋疲力尽]
♪ 我看到事情经过

19:22.172 --> 19:25.068
- ♪ WHEN I'M
ON THE ROAD ♪
- ♪ 当我
在路上♪

19:25.172 --> 19:27.758
- ♪ GOT A BUG
IN MY EYE ♪
- ♪ 有一个错误
在我眼里♪

19:27.862 --> 19:31.413
- ♪ WHEN I'M
ON THE ROAD ♪
- ♪ 当我
在路上♪

19:31.517 --> 19:34.137
- ♪ LOOKS LIKE
CLEAR SKIES AHEAD ♪
- ♪ 看起来像
前方晴朗的天空♪

19:34.241 --> 19:38.482
- ♪ WHEN I'M--
[coughs]
- ♪ 当我--
[咳嗽]

19:38.586 --> 19:40.413
♪ ON THE ROAD
♪ 在路上

19:40.517 --> 19:43.551
- ♪ PLEASE STOP
TOUCHING MY HEAD ♪
- ♪ 请停下来
摸摸我的头♪

19:43.655 --> 19:47.206
- ♪ LET'S ALL SING
THE ROAD SONG ♪
- ♪ 让我们一起唱歌
路歌♪

19:47.310 --> 19:48.965
[slow clapping]
[缓慢鼓掌]

19:49.068 --> 19:52.655
♪ I WANT TO SING IT
ALL DAY LONG ♪
♪ 我想唱这首歌
一整天♪

19:52.758 --> 19:57.068
♪ LET'S ALL SING THE--
[coughs]
♪ 让我们一起唱——
[咳嗽]

19:57.172 --> 19:58.310
[sighs]
[叹气]

19:58.413 --> 20:01.241
- SPONGEBOB,
MAYBE WE OUGHTTA TAKE A BREAK
- 海绵宝宝，
也许我们应该休息一下

20:01.344 --> 20:03.724
FROM THE SINGING
FOR A WHILE.
从歌声中
有一段时间了。

20:03.827 --> 20:04.931
- GOOD IDEA,
PATRICK.
- 好主意，
帕特里克。

20:05.034 --> 20:06.655
I'LL JUST PLAY THE ROAD SONG
ON THIS WHISTLE,
我只会播放路歌
在这个口哨声中，

20:06.758 --> 20:08.413
THAT I GOT
FROM THE SOUVENIR SHOP.
我得到的
从纪念品商店。

20:08.517 --> 20:10.517
[whistles]
[口哨声]

20:10.620 --> 20:18.620
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪

20:20.965 --> 20:23.448
- OH, HEY, SON.
WE'RE READY TO GO.
- 哦，嘿，儿子。
我们准备好了。

