♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪

20:59.931 --> 21:01.206
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪

21:02.103 --> 21:03.793
- WOW,
SPONGEBOB,
- 哇，
海绵宝宝，

21:03.896 --> 21:05.310
YOU'RE PRETTY GOOD
WITH THAT THING.
你很好
有了那个东西。

21:05.413 --> 21:07.275
- OH, THANKS, PATRICK,
GLAD YOU THINK SO.
- 哦，谢谢，帕特里克，
很高兴你这么认为。

21:07.379 --> 21:08.586
- WELL,
- 出色地，

21:08.689 --> 21:10.482
APPARENTLY, I'M NOT
THE ONLY ONE WHO DOES.
显然，我不是
唯一这样做的人。

21:10.586 --> 21:11.827
- WHAT DO YOU MEAN?
WHO ELSE THINKS--
- 你是什么意思？
还有谁认为——

21:11.931 --> 21:13.482
OH, NO,
NOT AGAIN.
哦，不，
不会再有。

21:14.896 --> 21:16.896
- THE WHISTLE SEEMS
TO HAVE SOOTHED IT.
- 哨声似乎
安抚它。

21:17.000 --> 21:18.862
- I THINK
IT'S OFFERING US A RIDE.
- 我认为
它正在为我们提供搭便车。

21:21.310 --> 21:24.862
♪ ROAD, ROAD,
ROAD, ROAD, ♪
♪ 路，路，
路，路，♪

21:24.965 --> 21:27.379
♪ ROAD, ROAD,
ROAD, ROAD, ♪
♪ 路，路，
路，路，♪

