- ♪ ROAD, ROAD, ROAD, ROAD,
- ♪ 在一只巨大的果蝇上
- ♪ 路，路，路，路，

21:42.344 --> 21:45.379
- ♪ WHEN I'M ABOVE THE ROAD
- ♪ ROAD, ROAD, ROAD, ROAD,
- ♪ 当我在路上时
- ♪ 路，路，路，路，

21:45.482 --> 21:48.310
both: ♪ HE USED TO
